<title>HONG KONG: S&amp;P rates Daya Guna unit's notes BB-plus.</title>
<headline>S&amp;P rates Daya Guna unit's notes BB-plus.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-05-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Standard &amp; Poor's said on Thursday it assigned a BB-plus rating to DGS International Finance Co B.V.'s US$225 million 10 percent guaranteed notes due in 2007.</p>
<p>S&amp;P said the issue carried a guarantee from PT Daya Guna Samudera TBK.</p>
<p>It said the rating reflected Daya Guna's &quot;highly profitable, low-cost fishery operations and favourable growth prospects, supported by access to abundant fish resources&quot;.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong newsroom (852) 2843 6371</p>
</text>
